        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Safari does not support `localhost` exception for `Secure` cookies]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28461</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28461"/>
        <updated>2025-11-21T19:28:37.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54687718?u=a1ad4b5e0600c9029222f99e5df2c7ef7ae19a59&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">Hi <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/hamishwillee/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/hamishwillee">@hamishwillee</a>,</p>
<p dir="auto">As per your request on <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3583703942" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41795" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/41795/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41795">mdn/content#41795</a>, I'm opening this PR to add the note about Safari's <code class="notranslate">localhost</code> exception for <code class="notranslate">Secure</code> cookies directly to the BCD.</p>
<p dir="auto">I've added the note to the main <code class="notranslate">Set-Cookie</code> support block for Safari, as <code class="notranslate">Secure</code> isn't tracked as a separate sub-feature. Please let me know if this is the correct location!</p>
<hr>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Adds a BCD note to the <code class="notranslate">Set-Cookie</code> header, clarifying that Safari does not support the <code class="notranslate">localhost</code> exception for the <code class="notranslate">Secure</code> attribute.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<p dir="auto">This is a data-only change to add a <code class="notranslate">note</code>.</p>
<p dir="auto">Supporting information and related discussion:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Original WebKit bug report: <a href="https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=281149" rel="nofollow">https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=281149</a></li>
<li>This change follows the request from <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/hamishwillee/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/hamishwillee">@hamishwillee</a> in the related <code class="notranslate">mdn/content</code> PR (see below).</li>
</ul>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #41366.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3474798100" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41366" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/41366/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41366">mdn/content#41366</a><br>
Addresses discussion in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3583703942" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41795" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/41795/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41795">mdn/content#41795</a></p>]]></content>
